rged_at":"2026-01-26T21:04:53Z"},"body":"`set_item_id` changes the NativeMenu tag to the ID, but the tag is should always be the index.\r\nReproducible since at least 4.3\r\n\r\nWhen clicking on an item that had its ID changed to a value outside of the index range, it will error:\r\n`ERROR: Index p_idx = 103 is out of bounds (items.size() = 2).`\r\n\r\nExample reproduction script:\r\n```gdscript\r\n\tvar menu := PopupMenu.new()\r\n\tmenu.prefer_native_menu = true\r\n\tmenu.add_item(\"a\", 101)\r\n\tmenu.add_item(\"b\", 102)\r\n\tmenu.set_item_id(1, 103)\r\n\tadd_child(menu)\r\n\tmenu.popup()\r\n\t# now click on item 1 (\"b\")\r\n```\r\n\r\nAdded comment just in case, since most other `set_item_*` functions have something with the `global_menu` here.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115378/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115378/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null